page=99\",\"citation\":\"Official PDF p. 99: Part IV heading and Articles 36–38\"}],\"secondary_sources\":[],\"evidence_locator\":\"constitution_partiii_art12: Official PDF p. 69: Part III heading and Article 12 definition of “the State” | constitution_partiv: Official PDF p. 99: Part IV heading and Articles 36–38\"},\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"STATE_ONEDAY\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0}],\"nextCursor\":\"af6579da-c0f8-4814-a8c1-a46b3f20e09e\",\"hasMore\":true}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":300,"tags":["question-batch","question-batch:subtopic:v9:374ec737-05bc-4d56-b42c-e334736e49c0"]}